      "value": "Reproduced on 1241\n1. Launch VRChat client\n2. Load into Home\n3. Open QM, open MM\n4. Go to Settings tab\n5. Click Performance\n6. Scroll to bottom\n7. Set Graphics Quality to Low\n8. Close MM\n9. Open QM, go to Gear Tab, click power button to close VRChat, click yes\n10. Repeat steps 1-6\nExpected: \nGraphics Quality is saved\nActual:\nGraphics quality reverts back to what it was previously (mine was High, not Ultra, and it reverted back to High vs Ultra as OP's report showed)",
